<title>USA: ATHLETICS-RESULTS OF THE U.S. COLLEGIATE CHAMPIONSHIPS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-RESULTS OF THE U.S. COLLEGIATE CHAMPIONSHIPS.</headline>
<dateline>BLOOMINGTON, Indiana 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the</p>
<p>first day of the four-day U.S. collegiate athletics</p>
<p>championships on Wednesday at Haugh Track at Indiana</p>
<p>University (U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>Women's discus</p>
<p> 1. Seilala Sua		    61.12 meters</p>
<p> 2. Suzy Powell		    60.54</p>
<p> 3. Anna Soderberg (Sweden)    59.70</p>
<p>Men's javelin</p>
<p> 1. Mats Nilsson (Sweden)	74.90</p>
<p> 2. Breaux Greer		   73.62</p>
<p>3. Daniel Gustafsson (Sweden) 72.38</p>
<p>Women's long jump</p>
<p> 1. Trecia Smith (Jamaica)     6.65</p>
<p> 2. Shonda Swift		   6.47</p>
<p> 3. Pat Itanyi (Nigeria)	 6.41</p>
<p>Men's 10,000 metres</p>
<p>1. Mebrahtom Keflezighi (Eritrea)  28 minutes, 51.18 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Brad Hauser			  29:02.58</p>
<p> 3. Ryan Wilson			  29:06.81</p>
</text>
